# Server-only (Vercel serverless functions under api/) -- do NOT prefix with
# VITE_, that would expose them to the client bundle.
# Bug bin admin viewer (api/bug-reports.ts + src/pages/BugBin.tsx):
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY -- from the bline Supabase project's
#     Project Settings > API > service_role key. Bypasses RLS to read
#     bug_reports (the anon key intentionally has no SELECT policy there).
#   ADMIN_SECRET -- any long random string you choose. Required as the
#     `x-admin-key` header value to read /api/bug-reports (bline has no
#     login system, so this is the only gate on the bin).
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=<bline service role key>
ADMIN_SECRET=<pick a long random string>
